# Linux Log Analysis and Investigation

## Overview

This project focused on analyzing multiple Linux log files to identify authentication activity, investigate suspicious events, and extract meaningful information from system, web server, and application logs. Using native Linux command-line tools, I examined log file metadata, searched for indicators of suspicious activity, analyzed authentication failures, reviewed HTTP response codes, and identified patterns that could indicate potential security issues.

